#: ../../source/users/element/collection/default_collection.rst:5
msgid "QET collection"
msgstr "QET 收藏"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/default_collection.rst:7
msgid ""
"The QET collection is the default collection from QElectroTech. This "
"collection is protected and the user can only read it, the QET collection "
"cannot be edited. The user cannot add any `element`_, any category or sub-"
"category and cannot re-organize the `elements`_ in the database."
msgstr ""
"QET 收藏是 QElectroTech 的默认收藏。 此收藏是受保护的，用户只能读取它，QET 收藏不能编辑 。 用户不能添加任何 `元件 "
"<element_>`_，任何类或子类，也不能重新组织数据库中的 `元件 <elements_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/default_collection.rst:14
msgid "Figure: QET collection tree at collection panel"
msgstr "图：收集面板上的QET采集树"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/default_collection.rst:16
msgid "The QET collection has the following categories:"
msgstr "QET收藏有以下几类："

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/default_collection.rst
msgid "Electric"
msgstr "电器"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/default_collection.rst:20
msgid ""
"Collection of electrical components (motors, converters, switches, "
"electrical protections, etc.)"
msgstr "收集电力部件(机动车、转换器、开关、电保护等)"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/default_collection.rst
msgid "Logic"
msgstr "逻辑"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/default_collection.rst:24
msgid ""
"Logic signal symbols (AND, OR, NOT, NOR, etc.), GRAFCET symbols, Ladder "
"symbols and flow char symbols."
msgstr "逻辑信号符号(AND,OR,NOT,NOR等),GRAFCET符号，梯形符号和流字符符号。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/default_collection.rst
msgid "Hydraulic"
msgstr "水力学"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/default_collection.rst:28
msgid ""
"Collection of hydraulic components (Pumps, cylinders, pressure limit valves,"
" pressure relief valves, directional valves, etc.)"
msgstr "收集液压部件(泵、气瓶、压力限制阀、降压阀、定向阀等)"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/default_collection.rst
msgid "Pneumatic"
msgstr "肺脏"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/default_collection.rst:32
msgid ""
"Collection of hydraulic components (Compressor, cylinders, air filters, "
"directional valves, etc.)"
msgstr "收集液压部件(压缩机、气瓶、空气过滤器、定向阀等)"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/default_collection.rst
msgid "Energy"
msgstr "能源"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/default_collection.rst:36
msgid ""
"Collection of elements used at the energy field (pumps, turbines, solar "
"panels, heat exchangers, etc.)"
msgstr "收集能源领域使用的元素(泵、涡轮机、太阳能板、热交换器等)"
